{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7969aa9dc5a833d9f40","chatId":"ecd4699b7d1145428bc0ec03c3dfdad8","sessionId":null,"userId":99684,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1029,"promptTokens":513,"completionTokens":103,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:38"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068391498485047,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7969aa9dc5a833d9f3f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484118285,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7969aa9dc5a833d9f3f","chatId":"ecd4699b7d1145428bc0ec03c3dfdad8","sessionId":null,"userId":99684,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小马的奶奶在去世前给了他一个家族祖传的戒指。她嘱咐他要继续向下一代传递下去。昨天，小马的朋友，小杰借了这枚戒指，将其纳入家族价值观和遗产介绍中。介绍之后，他找不到戒指了，不论如何也找不到。于是，他提出给小马买一个类似的还回来。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小马最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 气恼 & 感激\nB) 爱护 & 惊喜\nC) 气恼 & 尴尬\nD) 反对 & 惊喜\nE) 气恼 & 反对\nF) 反对 & 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n小马为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小杰把奶奶给他的戒指弄丢了\nB) 小杰提出要买一个换他奶奶的戒指，这对小马来说是独一无二的，不可替代的\nC) 杰森丢了他的奶奶给他的戒指\nD) 杰森提出愿意花大价钱替换他奶奶的戒指\nE) 杰森邀请他参加其家庭价值和传统的演讲\nF) 杰森借用了戒指作为他的演讲道具\nG) 他的奶奶准备责备他","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068391498485047,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7969aa9dc5a833d9f40","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484118282,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ea3b20d1ac7b41d39fe05649811c93d0"}